OpenSimParser:
    - Scripts able to transform the files containing data collected from imus to OpenSim compatible files
    - Sample imu data are included

Reading1IMU:
    - MCU code for a single imu per MCU
    - Python script for saving imu data in .txt files
    - IMU visualization using processing

Reading2IMU:
    - MCU code for two imus per MCU
    - Python script for saving imu data in .txt files
    - Double IMU visualization using processing

*** rp_pico_read_data.py in Reading1IMU and Reading2IMU are the same script